<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%"><tr><td style="font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.65;color:#161B20;padding:0 0 14px;">Hello Nasir,</td></tr><tr><td class="lead" style="font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;color:#161B20;padding:0 0 8px;letter-spacing:-.4px">The $19.00 invoice is correct.</td></tr><tr><td style="font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.5;color:#7C868E;padding:0 0 24px;">I reviewed our usage and reconciled it against the plan: 15 billable calls this period, no overage, no discrepancy.</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 0 24px"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:separate"><tr><td bgcolor="#FFF8DF" style="background:#FFF8DF;border:1px solid #F1DD95;border-top:1px solid #FFFCEF;border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px 18px"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#FBE8A6" style="background:#FBE8A6;border-radius:999px;padding:3px 10px;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;color:#6E5300">&#9679;&nbsp; Good to know</td></tr></table><div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#3F3A2B;padding-top:8px">The charge is RentCast&#x27;s Pro plan, the same account our API key runs on, billed monthly at $19.</div><div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#3F3A2B;padding-top:8px">Paying annually would bring it down to $12 a month if we want to switch later and save.</div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 0 10px"><a href="https://propertyanalysis.synergylenders.com/system-analysis/pricing" style="text-decoration:none"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dmqyhwiwu/image/upload/v1790264823/screenshotPropertyIntelligenceTrackerPricing_rblpt8.png" width="512" height="300" alt="System Analysis pricing page showing this month&#x27;s RentCast calls and a calls-over-time chart" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:512px;height:auto;border:1px solid #DFE3E5;border-radius:12px"></a></td></tr><tr><td style="font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.45;color:#7C868E;padding:0 0 24px;">Live usage from our System Analysis page. Click the image to open it.</td></tr><tr><td style="font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.65;color:#2B333A;padding:0 0 24px;">View live usage and costs: <a href="https://propertyanalysis.synergylenders.com/system-analysis/pricing" style="color:#0071E3;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;word-break:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-wrap:break-word"><span style="color:#0071E3">propertyanalysis.synergylenders.com/<wbr>system-analysis/<wbr>pricing</span></a></td></tr><tr><td style="font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.65;color:#2B333A;padding:0 0 4px;">Best regards,</td></tr><tr><td style="font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.65;color:#161B20;padding:0;">Shadrian</td></tr></table>
</td></tr></table>
